@startuml
title lists-service v1 - Implemented logical data model

hide methods
hide stereotypes
skinparam shadowing false

note as StatusNote
  VERIFIED API CONTRACT MODEL - NOT A LOCAL DATABASE
  Todoist remains the system of record.
  Provider fields checked against Todoist API v1 on 2026-07-31.
end note

entity "Todoist Project" as Project {
  * id : string <<provider identity>>
  --
  name : string
}

entity "Todoist Task / ShoppingListItem" as Item {
  * id : string <<provider identity>>
  --
  * projectId : string <<provider reference>>
  * content : string
  description : string [0..1]
  * isCompleted : boolean
  createdAt : timestamp [0..1]
  completedAt : timestamp [0..1]
}

entity "Runtime Configuration" as Configuration {
  * todoistTokenSecretReference : secret reference
  --
  todoistProjectId : string [preferred]
  todoistProjectName : string [fallback]
  * restApiTokenSecretReference : secret reference
  * life2JwtSigningKeySecretReference : secret reference
  * life2AllowedAccountId : identifier
  * alexaSkillId : string
  * logLevel : string
  * completedLookbackDays : integer (1..90)
}

Project ||--o{ Item : contains
Configuration ..> Project : selects exactly one

note right of Configuration
  Stores references and identifiers only.
  Secret values are retrieved at runtime from
  AWS Secrets Manager or local read-only files.
  A name-only project is created when absent;
  its resolved ID scopes repository operations.
  This is configuration, not persisted
  application-domain data.
end note

StatusNote .. Item

@enduml
